---

<section
  class="py-section-gap px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto"
  id="keunggulan"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-16">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span
        class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest"
        >Keunggulan Kami</span
      >
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">
        Mengapa Memilih Aurum Teak?
      </h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-px bg-primary/30 mt-2"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <!-- Point 1 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4">
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">forest</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-xl text-primary">
          Jati Perhutani Grade A
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
          Hanya menggunakan kayu jati tua pilihan dengan serat terbaik untuk
          ketahanan maksimal.
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Point 2 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4">
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">handyman</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-xl text-primary">
          Pengrajin Berpengalaman
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
          Dikerjakan oleh tangan-tangan ahli asli Jepara yang telah mewarisi
          keahlian turun-temurun.
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Point 3 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4">
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">design_services</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-xl text-primary">
          Desain Custom Eksklusif
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
          Wujudkan furniture impian Anda dengan layanan desain yang disesuaikan
          dengan kebutuhan.
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Point 4 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4">
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">local_shipping</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-xl text-primary">
          Pengiriman Aman &amp; Bergaransi
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
          Pengemasan standar ekspor dan garansi keamanan hingga pesanan tiba di
          rumah Anda.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
